    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "482d71c6_b588b87e",
        "filename": "tests/siso_test.py",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 40,
      "author": {
        "id": 1450817
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-03T03:08:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On the other hand, I think many siso users probably think of siso as a drop-in replacement for ninja, and so would likely expect `-k\u003d0` to be valid to put in unprefixed. They probably don\u0027t think of ninja as a subcommand of siso, but rather as siso itself.\n\nSeperating `startup` and specific subcommands would make that mistake a lot harder to make.",
      "parentUuid": "946fa84d_806a082d",
      "revId": "e9bd9f37b442068dbc1c5698ca856b4a2fb71a8c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "72849188_b3377a80",
        "filename": "tests/siso_test.py",
