      "author": {
        "id": 1001939
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-03T03:11:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "original ninja\u0027s default behavior is -k\u003d1, not -k\u003d0\n```\nninja.cc:\"  -k N     keep going until N jobs fail (0 means infinity) [default\u003d1]\\n\"\n```\n\nI don\u0027t think we need to have startup prefix for global flags. (and it will prevent having `startup` subcmd in future..)",
      "parentUuid": "482d71c6_b588b87e",
      "revId": "e9bd9f37b442068dbc1c5698ca856b4a2fb71a8c",
